                                                "sense_id": "0553cb25-3ef0-3660-9c7a-61ff53d1d2cd",
                                                "text": "My little brother is such a sneak; yesterday I caught him trying to look through my diary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b2731897-524b-3af9-8f1b-bd11e8f88218",
